### Notes

§6 contract case, original `let f = twice` spelling: the multi-file package
path admits a local free fn as a value alongside `use lib.id` imports
(PLAN-1095 T-02 packages/binding.rs Auto-language lane), a generic imported
fn called through a list literal, and indexing — all in one program. No
content-based profile switching; the ordinary `auto` profile carries the
whole source.

## Case: task-language-composition
id: "av.parity.1095.task-language-composition"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1095", "composition"]
links: ["PLAN-1095"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
task Q { on { n int -> { reply(n + 1) } } }
fn get() int {
 let h = Task.spawn("Q", 1)
 let v = await h.ask(41)
 h.stop()
 return v
}
fn main() int {
 let meta = { label: "ready", enabled: true }
 try { if meta.enabled { return get() }; return 0 } finally { }
}
```

### Probe av
recipe: "ac-av/language-source-run-v1"
