### Notes

§6 contract case: task spawn/ask/await/stop, an anonymous record literal with
mixed str/bool fields, field projection and try/finally all compose in one
ordinary source. CPU-only observation; no UI/GPU started.

## Case: cte-and-ordinary-library
id: "av.parity.1095.cte-and-ordinary-library"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1095", "composition"]
links: ["PLAN-1095"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn scale<T>(n T) T { return n + n }
fn main() int {
 let seed = #{ scale(21) }
 let xs = [seed - 1, seed]
 return xs.filter((x int) => x == 42)[0]
}
```

