### Notes

§6 contract case, typed-lambda spelling of the draft's elided `x =>`
(audited 1081/1082 normalization — the face has no lambda parameter
inference): a generic fn evaluated at compile time, flowing into a runtime
list literal and a typed filter HOF call. `ct_execute=1`; the CT call itself
leaves no runtime frame while the list/filter lane does run.

